# OneXPlayer X2 Mini
#
# InputPlumber's service is shipped 'disabled' and is started on demand by
# /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/90-inputplumber-autostart.rules, which only fires when
# the hwdb sets USE_INPUTPLUMBER=1 for this machine's DMI modalias.
#
# The stock /usr/lib/udev/hwdb.d/60-inputplumber-autostart.hwdb has no entry
# for the X2 Mini, so the service never started. This adds one.
#
# Local modalias:
#   dmi:...:svnONE-NETBOOK:pnONEXPLAYERX2MiniPRO:...:rnONEXPLAYERX2MiniPRO:...
#
# Matched on product_name so the non-PRO X2 Mini is covered too.
dmi:*svnONE-NETBOOK:*pnONEXPLAYERX2Mini*
  USE_INPUTPLUMBER=1
